   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; i1040sd p. 15: \"Complete this worksheet only if line 18 or line 19 of Schedule D is more than zero and lines 15 and 16 of Schedule D are gains or if you file Form 4952 and you have an amount on line 4g,\" with the Exception for a zero-or-less line 15 or 16 and no qualified dividends. The project's gate is the trigger shared by both capital gain worksheets; the candidate makes it exclusive of the Schedule D Tax Worksheet, so on 44 completed returns with that worksheet in force it answers false where the project answers true. Line 16 takes sdtw.line47 first, so the gate changes no tax on those returns; the 3 candidate refusals are on returns the project refuses. Triage executable-triage-v2 (.transcription/triage/2025/f1040.json): 3,187 of 3,422 agree, 2,403 of 2,492 in scope. Project stands.",
