   "ruling": "Ruling: model error — The printed line 6c is a lump-sum-benefits election (i1040gi p. 31). With zero benefits there is no election to make; the project returns false and does not ask ssb.lump_sum. The candidate requires that unasked answer (79 completed candidate-unknown witnesses) and exposes a supplied true answer on 19 already-refused records. No supported positive-benefit election discrepancy was observed. Evidence: triage/f1040.json, executable-triage-v2, 2240 comparisons, 1035 agreements; differences by return state {\"completed\": {\"candidate-unknown\": 79}, \"incomplete\": {\"candidate-unknown\": 760}, \"refused\": {\"candidate-unknown\": 347, \"value\": 19}}. Sample witnesses: {\"id\": \"classm.s179.2\", \"kind\": \"fixture\"}, {\"id\": \"stage14.sc.basic\", \"kind\": \"fixture\"}.",
